type: dataset
title: "VPS and proxy list prices by country, 2026-10 snapshot"
abstract: >-
  Public list prices of VPS/VDS hosting (603 offers, 25 providers, 32 countries) and
  paid proxies (455 rows, 31 brands), taken from providers' own pricing pages between
  2026-08-30 and 2026-09-24. RUB and EUR converted to USD at a fixed Bank of Russia
  snapshot dated 2026-09-24.
